{"author":{"id":"836d943203cf5a4f01ab5d4b4780de84949c43734f2256a167cc5931ae5d8c66"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794180705,"nonce":"jOSX5FRrWT0MaxhYzr0Y1s9tpIU=","title":"L4 — Animated floating tooltips","message":"## Context\nIcon-only buttons (`components::icon_pill`, `src/ui/components.rs:46`; the row toggles at `src/ui/screen.rs:1008`; the detail-pane close button) have no labels. iced's `tooltip` (`iced_widget-0.14.2/src/tooltip.rs`) has `delay`, `gap` and `snap_within_viewport`, but no enter or exit animation and no flip.\n\n## Files\n- `src/ui/tooltip.rs` — new widget\n- `src/ui/components.rs` — `icon_pill` and friends take a label\n- `src/ui/screen.rs`, `src/ui/detail.rs`, `src/ui/done.rs` — call sites\n- `src/theme/style.rs` — `tooltip` container style (`surface`, `border`, soft shadow, `radius::MD`)\n\n## Approach\n- A custom `Widget` wrapping the content, with an overlay similar to floating-ui:\n  - Opens after hovering for 350ms. Once one tooltip has been shown, moving to the next within 300ms opens it instantly (the \"warm\" group).\n  - Fades in and slides 4px over 120ms using `Animation`, and fades out over 80ms. Calls `shell.request_redraw()` only while animating.\n  - Placement prefers bottom, flips to top when it would overflow the viewport, and shifts horizontally to stay inside it, with an 8px gap.\n  - Closes on press, on scroll and when the cursor leaves.\n- Optional trailing shortcut hint (`text` in `text_subtle`). L5 fills these in.\n- Every icon-only control gets a tooltip\n\n## Depends on\nL3 — the sidebar rail is icon-only and needs tooltips\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Unit tests for the pure placement function: flips to top near the bottom edge, shifts left near the right edge, and stays below otherwise\n- Unit test for the open-delay state machine: cold delay, warm instant open, close on press\n- Every top-bar icon button, the collapsed sidebar items and the row toggle show a tooltip\n- Gates pass","files":null}]}